%%{init: {'theme':'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Citizen
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant JP as journey-planner-service
    participant TT as Transport Operators feed (mock)
    participant EM as Emission-factor source (mock)

    Citizen->>GW: POST /journeys/plan {origin, destination, maxDurationMins?, modes?}
    GW->>JP: POST /journeys/plan
    Note over JP: 3.1 trip request received

    par 3.2 parallel split (scatter)
        JP->>TT: 3.3 retrieve scheduled services
        TT-->>JP: 3.5 train (if a rail link exists), bus
    and
        JP->>EM: 3.4 retrieve per-mode emission factors
        EM-->>JP: 3.6 train 0.04, bus 0.10, bike 0, drive 0.17 kg/km
    end
    Note over JP: 3.7 parallel join (gather)

    JP->>JP: 3.8 candidate routes (bike share only if ≤ 15 km)
    JP->>JP: 3.9 append CO2-e estimate to each route
    par 3.10 inclusive split: only modes meeting the constraints
        JP->>JP: prepare train options
    and
        JP->>JP: prepare bus options
    and
        JP->>JP: prepare bike share options
    end
    Note over JP: 3.11 inclusive join (at least one mode always kept)
    JP->>JP: 3.12 rank by CO2 ascending

    JP-->>GW: 200 ranked options + driving baseline (3.13)
    GW-->>Citizen: journey plan
